## AlphaDroid ##

AlphaDroid is a custom ROM for Android, based on LineageOS/crDroid, with a new look and some extra features and optimizations. Extra features are picked from other custom ROMs and adapted to our needs or implemented by us.

Credits:

* Base:
  * [crDroid Android](https://github.com/crDroidAndroid)
  * [LineageOS](https://github.com/LineageOS)

* UI:
  * [Bootleggers](https://github.com/bootleggersrom)
  * [dotOS](https://github.com/dotos)
  * [NusantaraProject](https://github.com/nusantaraproject-rom)

* Extras:
  * [PixelOS](https://github.com/PixelOS-AOSP)
  * [RisingOS-Revived](https://github.com/RisingOS-Revived)
  * [VoltageOS](https://github.com/VoltageOS)
  * [YAAP](https://github.com/yaap/)

* Alpha logo and banners:
  * [naokoshoto](https://github.com/naokoshoto)

### Sync ###

```bash
# Initialize local repository
repo init -u https://github.com/alphadroid-project/manifest -b alpha-16.2 --git-lfs

# Sync
repo sync
```

### Build ###

```bash
# Set up environment
$ . build/envsetup.sh

# Build the code using lunch + make
$ lunch alpha_<device_codename>-<build_variant> && make bacon

# Or just brunch it
$ brunch <device_codename> # user builds
$ brunch alpha_<device_codename>-<build_variant> # other variants
```

#### Build environment ####

If you need help to create a build environment, you can check crDroid instructions [here](https://github.com/crdroidandroid/android).
